    ENG-1879 Read the published node back through the discovery listing

    Both imports discover shared nodes with listGroupSharedNodes and find each node's space with getSharedNodeSpace, so the scenario reads back the same way, as the reader space, instead of through the refresh lookup and a service-role read of the publisher's space. The acceptance criterion now says full comes from the full content row.

